  "details": "- CVE-2026-76578: constrain the self-managed OTP token ACI, deny anonymous\n  modifications and harden self-service and delegated-write ACIs\n- CVE-2026-79678: enforce managed permissions before LDAP-oriented commands\n  run their callbacks, and require privileges for RA-agent backed operations\n- CVE-2026-13097: enforce Kerberos principal name uniqueness with a\n  principal-aware matching rule (new ipa-krbprinc-mr 389-ds plugin)\n- CVE-2026-11861: validate the PAC of cross-realm trust tickets in the KDB\n  driver, including ID override checks\n- CVE-2026-73198: limit the request body size of the unauthenticated\n  /ipa/i18n_messages endpoint\n- CVE-2026-73197: reject oversized Content-Length in the unauthenticated\n  password migration endpoint\n- CVE-2026-19550: require write access to the trust entry for\n  trust-fetch-domains\n- CVE-2026-18147: remove the redirect from the Web UI password reset page",
